  {
    "hotel_id": "2129",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-grand-central/hotel/singapore-sg.html",
    "name": "Hotel Grand Central",
    "detail": "Staff was attentive, rooms are pretty small, can't open a window, felt a bit claustrophobic, but that is a negative with many hotels in Singapore. Hotel could do way better with a bit more TLC in the hallways, a little freshup of colours and general cleaning of the bathrooms (not just the everyday stuff). 24 check-in worked very well for us. Location was great for shopping on Orchard Rd, if you like shopping. Considering other experiences in Singapore, the hotel is ok for the price. The pool is great and the kids pool is actually pretty good with it's 40cm depth. There is some streetfood available just outside the hotel, Starbucks and other well known restaurants/cafes are just 3 mins walking distance away. Took us 20 mins with pram to walk to Chinatown. So, if you don't want to pay for a highend hotel in Singapore and need a convenient place to stay, this one is ok and won't break the bank.",
